{"id":"e40b751ec8490f91","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-supercompact-embeddings.md","title":"Supercompact Embeddings","display":"thm-supercompact-embeddings — Supercompact Embeddings","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-supercompact-embeddings","aliases":["58-thm-supercompact-embeddings","Supercompact Embedding Characterization","Supercompact via Embeddings"],"display":"thm-supercompact-embeddings — Supercompact Embeddings","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-supercompact-embeddings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-supercompact-embeddings</span><span>Supercompact Embedding Characterization</span><span>Supercompact via Embeddings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supercompact-embeddings — Supercompact Embeddings"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a15944d89f213496\" href=\"?note=a15944d89f213496\" title=\"../batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md\">../batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span> (cardinals), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive class), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> (a class function in the metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\operatorname{Supercompact},\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\operatorname{Supercompact},\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\)</span> (set of formulas in the language of membership)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction for proper-class structures)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embeddings} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec a,n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a))\\to(V\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow M\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;((\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq M)\\to s\\in M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embeddings} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\exists j\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land j:V\\to M\\land[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec a,n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec a))\\to(V\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow M\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a]))]\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;((\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(s))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq M)\\to s\\in M)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sequences and transitivity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> are part of the external class-embedding characterization; closure is expanded using set-coded functions whose ranges lie in the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Elementarity is expanded for the proper-class map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>; the set-sized three-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> predicate is not applicable to a map with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Supercompactness yields strong reflection from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> to smaller ranks.</li>\n<li>Supercompactness is stronger than strongness and measurability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"a15944d89f213496","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-supercompact-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\operatorname{Supercompact},\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}embeddings} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Supercompact}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Car